02:56:41.425 --> 02:56:42.550
I could take notes on this.

02:56:42.550 --> 02:56:43.508
And take notes on this.

02:56:43.508 --> 02:56:47.350
And it's assembled in a
very digestible way that

02:56:47.350 --> 02:56:52.900
allows people to extract
the meaningful parts

02:56:52.900 --> 02:56:53.750
in every chapter.

02:56:53.750 --> 02:56:56.900
And there are so many in a way
that's very straightforward.

02:56:56.900 --> 02:56:58.592
So I love the book.

02:56:58.592 --> 02:57:00.550
So thank you for doing
it because you certainly

02:57:00.550 --> 02:57:02.840
